   - 4-6: Coherent but not compelling
   - 7-10: Clear story arc with natural CTA

4. AUDIENCE_FIT (1-10): Would the target audience connect with this?
   - 1-3: Wrong tone or irrelevant to audience
   - 4-6: Acceptable for the audience
   - 7-10: Perfectly tailored to the audience

